      "body": "Refs #7587 — scope item 4 of the #5830 sharing model (slices 1–2 merged as #7953 and #12206).\n\nThe three reference edges live in BoardGraph and backlinks are a query over the same edge store:\n\n- note_anchors(): reply —anchors→ note-version/passage edges from Post::note_anchor.\n- note_discussions(): post —discusses→ note edges derived from thread membership (a post in a thread where another post embeds the note).\n- note_edges_from(): forward jump-through per post (embeds, anchors, discusses).\n- note_backlinks(): reverse query over all three edge kinds, deduped, deterministic; a post counts once however many edges name the note.\n- Removing a post (active supersede/tombstone) removes its forward edges; superseding the tombstone restores them.\n- Follow-up fix: a plain post in a sharing thread backlinks the note via its discusses edge, so the pre-existing slice-1 test now asserts the union backlink set.\n\nVerification (remote dispatch only, fleet-command.yml fallback): cargo test --lib boards on this branch — 87 passed, 0 failed — in two runs: https://github.com/developing-today/fleet/actions/runs/45165313624 and https://github.com/developing-today/fleet/actions/runs/45166519603.\n\nDoes not close #7587 — slice 4 (cross-server) remains.\n\n<!-- pm-metadata:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"direct_parent\": null,\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"lineage\": {\n    \"design\": null,\n    \"roadmap_item\": null,\n    \"priority\": null\n  },\n  \"pm_meta\": 1,\n  \"provenance\": {\n    \"queue_id\": null,\n    \"scheduled_start\": null,\n    \"picked_up_at\": null,\n    \"work_started_at\": null,\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-11-23T11:48:48Z\",\n    \"session_id\": null,\n    \"lane\": null,\n    \"host\": \"htch-runtime\",\n    \"worktree\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/github-work/code-7587\",\n    \"model\": null,\n    \"lane_start_issues\": [],\n    \"workspace_ref\": {\n      \"kind\": \"worktree\",\n      \"id\": \"/home/hatch/workspace/github-work/code-7587\",\n      \"repo\": \"developing-today/code\",\n      \"branch\": \"xaltha/7587-ref-edges\",\n      \"sha\": \"b86e5acfb7a3b199aae79725cd046f0a08d7cd98\"\n    },\n    \"auth_subject\": \"xaltha\",\n    \"stamped_by\": \"fleet 0.1.0 (native)\"\n  }\n}\n```\n<!-- pm-metadata:end -->\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1798026537&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=13233&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F13233&variant=run_proof_on_this_pr&signature=bc793c09a755d64dc2c013221357cd42852d6202a5684f8e5ccc5db7eb78e511\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-run-proof-on-this-pr-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-run-proof-on-this-pr-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Run Proof on this PR\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-run-proof-on-this-pr-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"168\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/13233?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
