      "body": "## Summary\n- Project NoteRef embeds into live or pinned content targets, preserving all concurrent live candidates and exposing a changed-since-posted indicator.\n- Fall back to the signed pinned version when live note data is unavailable.\n- Project exact/relocated reply anchors onto the current version, while orphaned replies remain on their original anchored version and passage.\n- Keep fetching and markup rendering outside the id package, consistent with its pure-projection boundary.\n\n## Verification\n- `rustfmt --edition 2024 --check pkgs/id/src/boards.rs pkgs/id/src/boards/records.rs`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Focused `cargo test --manifest-path pkgs/id/Cargo.toml -p id --lib note_anchor_tests` is running locally through `fleet-build-lock`.\n\nImplements #7587 slice 2 and decision invariants 2-3 from #5830.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1797838786&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=12206&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F12206&variant=get_evidence&signature=4a54c82e6ad64dff54e3aba810a18d40f9f5f7153dcb1c71ef4020c1b8c1e25a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-get-evidence-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-get-evidence-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Get evidence\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-get-evidence-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"123\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/12206?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
