        "merged_at": "2026-11-21T06:03:47Z"
      },
      "body": "Before: after #12061 and #12074 landed and Drew was unassigned everywhere, lanes still parked queue tasks \"awaiting explicit ownership handoff\" (#7616 parked again on 2026-11-20 18:01Z), because the gate lived on in each task's resume brief rather than in the assignee.\n\nAfter: AGENTS.md and `doc/agents/one-queue-claiming-work.md` say plainly that no ownership handoff exists, lanes must not park for one or write one into a resume brief, and a task's own earlier branch, worktree or draft PR is its own work.\n\nHow: two doc edits (AGENTS.md stays under its 8,000-byte budget; `research_workflow.py check` passes). Separately, the seven parked queue tasks that carried this gate (#7616, #7919, #9076, #9132, #10032, #2686, #7587) had their checkpoints reset and went back to the queue, and the laptop lane prompts got the same rule.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1797826158&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=12155&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F12155&variant=proof_this_pr&signature=b0368f2a2782eb024b92e96b7fdbbb80565260638ae735622b164b6136675e0f\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Proof this PR\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-proof-this-pr-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/12155?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\