      "body": "## What\nExplicit optional `payload.implementation_repo` selects the repository receiving the work, while `payload.repo` remains the tracking issue/dedupe identity. Both SQL claim scope (selection and atomic update) and pure filters honor the override. Marked `cross-repo-change` packets without a target are rejected by canonical validation, so legacy malformed packets quarantine with a repair diagnostic instead of cycling through code-only lanes.\n\nRefs #10415 (task20592: code-hosted issue, Kaneo implementation). This does not implement or close that issue.\n\n## Work-window contract\nReuse existing #3418 `required_budget_minutes` / `--remaining-budget-minutes`, not a new timeout or guessed effort mapping. Runbook documents recomputing usable remaining minutes per claim and preserving independent ownership holds. FDR-0011 records the decision.\n\n## Verification\n- Expected red: both new target/validation tests failed on baseline.\n- Final head28b498b01bfa25e81ebb25b94c53e35317f045a8: `cargo test -p fleet-queue --features queue-broker --lib`:424passed,0failed, via fleet-build-lock.\n- Includes isolated SQLite target/window matrix (negative filters, exact/short/missing budgets, parked requirement precedence), invoked by Rust suite.\n- git diff --check clean; schema JSON parses. External jsonschema validator unavailable.\n- Independent review completed; canonical validation mismatch corrected and suite rerun after merging current main.\n\n## Not live yet\nNo broker deployment/restart, schedule edits, or stored packet repair. Current broker has no supported payload-update verb; enqueue dedupe is not a repair. Task20592 still requires explicit target repair. Tasks20725/#7587 and20567/#10345 remain owner-handoff gated; no inferred duration or release. Do not call this production rollout complete.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797627764&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=11913&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F11913&signature=6e042aea17f7c36b0cb0dd585c8f09f98e383397b9411d6db4da5ece27eb451d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/11913?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
